    <p>AIOPlugins helps you build personalized Nuvio plugin repositories by selecting plugins from multiple GitHub sources. It combines selected manifest entries and serves the corresponding provider files through an account-specific repository URL.</p>
    <p>AIOPlugins is a middleman tool: it does not create or execute third-party provider code. Nuvio runs returned provider code in its own plugin runtime. Review upstream sources before selecting them.</p>
